      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Cảm ơn answers the traveler question \"Thank you\" in small service and first-contact moments. Say this anytime someone helps you, serves you, or gives directions. A short thank-you keeps service moments warm and simple. Its job is giving the other person a simple anchor rather than a long explanation. The forms below show how tone, setting, or politeness changes the best choice.",
